-- The order on decompositions: T precedes U when their partition sequences
-- and chosen colours agree below some stage at which U is strictly coarser
-- or chooses a larger colour. A finite family of decompositions into trees
-- and a rest has a maximal member.
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
